  "sizechartFitGuide": "<h3 class=\"modal-subtitle b-fit_heading\">핏 가이드</h3>\n<div class=\"fitguide-overflow g-carousel\">\n    <div class=\"fitguide-container fitguide-container--dynamic fitguide__list-bottoms js-carousel swiper-container\" data-cmp=\"carousel\" data-carousel-type=\"fitGuideSixCards\">\n        <div class=\"g-carousel-wrapper swiper-wrapper js-swiper-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"g-carousel-slide swiper-slide\">\n                <div class=\"fitguide__item\">\n                    <img class=\"fittype__img\" src=\"https://underarmour.scene7.com/is/image/Underarmour/M_Bottoms_Compression_Wht_2400x3000?wid=260\" alt=\"UA HG Elite Leggings\" />\n                    <p class=\"fitguide__title\">컴프레션</p>\n                    <div class=\"fitguide__description\">\n                        <p>피부에 부드럽게 감기는 울트라 타이트 핏으로, 근육을 안정적으로 잡아주어 최상의 퍼포먼스를 돕습니다.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"g-carousel-slide swiper-slide\">\n                <div class=\"fitguide__item\">\n                    <img class=\"fittype__img\" src=\"https://underarmour.scene7.com/is/image/Underarmour/M_Bottoms_Tight_Wht_2400x3000?wid=260\" alt=\"M Packaged Base 2.0 Legging\" />\n                    <p class=\"fitguide__title\">타이트</p>\n                    <div class=\"fitguide__description\">\n                        <p>컴프레션 특유의 압박감 없이 체형에 맞게 밀착되는 편안한 핏입니다.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"g-carousel-slide swiper-slide\">\n                <div class=\"fitguide__item\">\n                    <img class=\"fittype__img\" src=\"https://underarmour.scene7.com/is/image/Underarmour/M_Bottoms_Fitted_Wht_2400x3000?wid=260\" alt=\"Vanish Training Pant\" />\n                    <p class=\"fitguide__title\">피티드</p>\n                    <div class=\"fitguide__description\">\n                        <p>바디라인에 부드럽게 밀착되어 매끄러운 룩과 착용감을 제공합니다.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"g-carousel-slide swiper-slide\">\n                <div class=\"fitguide__item\">\n                    <img class=\"fittype__img\" src=\"https://underarmour.scene7.com/is/image/Underarmour/M_Bottoms_Regular_Wht_2400x3000?wid=260\" alt=\"UA Rival Flc Pants\" />\n                    <p class=\"fitguide__title\">레귤러</p>\n                    <div class=\"fitguide__description\">\n                        <p>너무 조이거나 헐렁하지 않은, 정석적인 클래식 핏입니다.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"g-carousel-slide swiper-slide\">\n                <div class=\"fitguide__item\">\n                    <img class=\"fittype__img\" src=\"https://underarmour.scene7.com/is/image/Underarmour/M_Bottoms_Relaxed_Wht_2400x3000?wid=260\" alt=\"UA Icon HW Terry Pants\" />\n                    <p class=\"fitguide__title\">릴랙스드</p>\n                    <div class=\"fitguide__description\">\n                        <p>활동성을 극대화하는 넉넉하고 여유로운 핏입니다.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"g-carousel-slide swiper-slide\">\n                <div class=\"fitguide__item\">\n                    <img class=\"fittype__img\" src=\"https://underarmour.scene7.com/is/image/Underarmour/M_Bottoms_Oversized_Wht_2400x3000?wid=260\" alt=\"UA Icon HW Flc Washed Pants\" />\n                    <p class=\"fitguide__title\">오버사이즈</p>\n                    <div class=\"fitguide__description\">\n                        <p>트렌디하게 과장된 느낌의 매우 넉넉한 핏과 디자인입니다.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"g-carousel-control m-next js-swiper-button js-swiper-button-next\">&nbsp;</div>\n        <div class=\"g-carousel-control m-prev js-swiper-button js-swiper-button-prev\">&nbsp;</div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
